==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Paldean form]] of {{p|Wooper}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Paldean Wooper|127}} from the {{TCG|Obsidian Flames}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Flop''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Magikarp|47}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's illustration rare artwork was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Paldean Wooper|221}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

